            <div xml:id="d84">

                <pb facs="0232" n="120" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg120"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/5252: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Tenney</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-09-22"><hi rendition="#italic">September 22,
                        1919</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 8:20 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>From [Harris at] Omsk.</p>
                <p>“389, September 20, 1 p.m. Have had President’s Kansas City and Des Moines
                    speeches on Bolshevikism published in Omsk papers. Same has created very
                    favorable impression. Harris.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Tenney</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
